      "statement": "A gatekeeper exposes a hierarchy of RPC capabilities: GatekeeperVendor (the service binding), GatekeeperUser (a connected account, 'already specialized for a particular human user', which only the Workshop itself may hold), and Gatekeeper<Session> (a per-resource binding executed as a Durable Object Facet under the Overseer).",
